# Contact form delivery.
#
# Without RESEND_API_KEY the endpoint returns 503 and the form tells the
# visitor plainly that it could not send, showing the address instead.
# It never claims a message went when it did not.
#
# 1. Create a key at https://resend.com (3,000 emails a month, free)
# 2. Verify arthoken.com as a sending domain
# 3. Add these three in Vercel under Settings > Environment Variables

RESEND_API_KEY=
CONTACT_TO=info@arthoken.com
CONTACT_FROM=Arthoken site <site@arthoken.com>
